let __v_181 = Value::from("Porridge is the better everyday bowl: oats are wholegrain, and a 40g serving has about 4g of fibre and no added sugar, so it keeps you full until lunch. Plain cereal does the same job with less fibre; granola and crunchy clusters are the ones to watch, because a 50g serving can carry 12 to 15g of sugar. If you want cold cereal, pick a wholegrain one with under 10g of sugar per 100g.");
