let __v_254 = Value::from("For protein, soya or pea: about 6 to 7g in 200ml, against 1 to 2g for oat, almond and rice. For coffee and porridge, oat, because it is creamy and does not split. For the fewest calories, almond or the coconut drink, at about 40 to 50 a glass. Whichever you pick, take the unsweetened one and check the carton says calcium and B12 added: calcium, iodine and B12 are the three milk supplies and a plant carton does not unless it says so.");
