let __v_255 = Value::from("Yes, on carbon every plant milk is far below dairy: a litre of oat or soya is about a third of dairy milk's emissions and a fraction of its land, rice is a little higher because paddy fields make methane, and almond is the lowest of them but the thirstiest, at several hundred litres of water a litre. So take oat or soya if it is water you are counting as well as carbon, and remember the carton matters much less than the swap: the milk nobody drinks is the worst of the lot.");
